    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rogue Wave is a turn based Board Game. You play as a Pirate Ship gathering weaponry and tools to attack and set claim to victory. As you play, the Rogue Wave closes in on you. This forces you to get closer to your opponents. You must out maneuver and out smart your opponents to keep afloat.\u00a0\u00a0</p>",
